Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: qcom_battmgr: name the houji battery "battery"

Armada names Qualcomm batteries "battery" (its 0503 battery-name patch),
and its MangoHud, which draws Steam's performance overlay, only reads
/sys/class/power_supply/battery. With "qcom-battmgr-bat" the overlay shows
no battery percentage, power or time remaining. Use the same name for the
houji battery.

--- a/drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c
@@ -1296,7 +1296,8 @@
 };
 
 static const struct power_supply_desc houji_bat_psy_desc = {
-	.name = "qcom-battmgr-bat",
+	/* Armada's battery name, which its MangoHud reads. */
+	.name = "battery",
 	.type = POWER_SUPPLY_TYPE_BATTERY,
 	.properties = houji_bat_props,
 	.num_properties = ARRAY_SIZE(houji_bat_props),
